What is Strategy Design Pattern ?

In Laymen term, we can say that in strategy design pattern we have multiple ways of doing a same task and
you want to be able to switch between them Easily.

To achieve this we Use Interface

Example Of Strategy Design Pattern

Suppose I want to do Payment, now Payment can be made using UPI, Credit Card, Netbanking, etc
So here there are multiple ways to do this task

Now Lets Implement it

interface PaymentStrategy(){
    void pay();
}

class UPIPayment implements PaymentStrategy(){
  void pay{
  Sysout("UPI Payment Done");
  }
}

class CreditCardPayment implements PaymentStrategy(){
   void pay(){
   Sysout("Credit Payment DOne");
   }
}

class Payment{
    PaymentStrategy payment;
    public Payment(PaymentStrategy p){
       this.payment = p;
    }

    void makePayment(){
        payment.pay();
    }

}

class Main(){
     main(){
        Payment p = new Payment(new UPIPayment());
        p.makePayment();
     }
}